 w or ski: 5 min\n• World's greatest stretch: 5/side\n• 90/90 hip switc
 hes: 8/side\n• Band pull-apart 15 + no-money external rotation 12\n• P
 rone Y-raise: 2 x 12\n• Pogo hops: 2 x 20\n• Ramp-up sets of the first
  lift: 2–3\n\nMain work (40 min\, 4 sets\, 1–2 reps in reserve):\n1. P
 ull-ups 🏅 (Day 1): 5 x 8\, 90 s rest\n2. Incline DB press 🏅 (about 4
 5°): 4 x 6–8\, 2–3 min rest\n3. Machine row or barbell row: 4 x 6–8
 \, 2 min rest\n4. Weighted dips\, leaning forward: 3 x 6–10\, 2 min rest
 \n5. Neutral/V-grip pulldown: 3 x 8–10\, 90 s rest\n6. Towel dead hang: 
 2 x max\, 90 s rest\n\nFunctional: wall balls (25 min\, the one wall-ball 
 block of the week):\n• 9 kg heavy wall balls to the 3.00 m target: 5 x 1
 0\n• 1 min rest between sets\n• Wall balls EMOM 12 min: 15 per minute 
 (6 kg\, 3.00 m)\n\nhttps://andyxuedct.github.io/Training-Plan/
