 \n• HR: under 155\n\nHome H2 in the afternoon (25 min):\n• Deficit pus
 h-ups\, hands on yoga blocks or books: 4 x (max − 2)\n• Band row: 4 x 
 15\n• Band fly: 3 x 15\n• Band curl + band pushdown: 2 x 15 each\n\nRe
 covery:\n• Foot and calf self-massage: 2 min\n• 90/90 hip switches: 8/
 side\n• Half-kneeling hip-flexor stretch: 45 s/side\n\nhttps://andyxuedc
 t.github.io/Training-Plan/
