 min):\n• Band lateral walk: 10 steps each way\n• Bodyweight squat: 15\
 n• Band RDL: 15\n• Glute bridge: 10\n\nRun (easy 12 km):\n• Pace: 5:
 50–6:20\, slower is fine\n• HR: under 155 the whole way\; walk 30 s if
  it drifts above\n• Your last two "easy" runs were 5:00–5:16 at 156–
 158 bpm\, which is too hard for an easy day\n\nRecovery after:\n• Foot a
 nd calf self-massage: 2 min\n• 90/90 hip switches: 8/side\n• Half-knee
 ling hip-flexor stretch: 45 s/side\n\nhttps://andyxuedct.github.io/Trainin
 g-Plan/
