 ing forward: 2 x 6–10\, 2 min rest\n5. Neutral/V-grip pulldown: 2 x 8–
 10\, 90 s rest\n6. Towel dead hang: 1 x max\, 90 s rest\n\nFunctional: wal
 l balls (10 min\, rhythm only):\n• 9 kg heavy wall balls: 3 x 10\n• 1 
 min rest between sets\n• No EMOM this week: Thursday ends with 100 wall 
