 • 俯卧颈部系列：用瑜伽砖\n\n—— English ——\nTime: 60 m
 in\nWarm-up (20 min):\n• Easy row or ski: 5 min\n• World's greatest st
 retch: 5/side\n• 90/90 hip switches: 8/side\n• Band pull-apart 15 + no
 -money external rotation 12\n• Prone Y-raise: 2 x 12\n• Pogo hops: 2 x
  20\n• Ramp-up sets of the first lift: 2–3\n\nLight legs (35 min\, 2 r
 eps in reserve):\n1. Paused front squat: 3 x 5\, 2–3 s at the bottom\, a
 bout 70% of max\, 2 min rest\n2. Bulgarian split squat: 2 x 8 each\, 90 s 
