 ge: 10\n\nRun (long run 18 km):\n• Pace: new E pace\n• At 60 min: prac
 tise your race-day gel or drink once\n\nHome H2 in the afternoon (25 min):
 \n• Deficit push-ups\, hands on yoga blocks or books: 4 x (max − 2)\n
 • Band row: 4 x 15\n• Band fly: 3 x 15\n• Band curl + band pushdown:
