 秒\n5. 弹力带臀推 ★：3 x 8–10，顶端停1秒，休息90秒\n6.
  北欧挺 ★：3 x 5–6，下放越慢越好，休息90秒\n7. 腿屈
 伸（椅背后仰）🏅：2 x 12–15，休息60秒\n8. 站姿杠铃提
 踵 3 x 10 + 屈膝提踵（比目鱼肌）2 x 15，休息60秒\n\n今天
 不做功能性： 周四的全程模拟已经练过所有站点，包括
 划船和农夫行走。\n\n晚上（可选，10分钟）：\n• 世界
 最伟大伸展：每侧5次\n• 90/90髋部换边：每侧8次\n• 俯
 卧颈部系列：用瑜伽砖\n\n—— English ——\nTime: 70 min\nWar
 m-up (20 min):\n• Easy row or ski: 5 min\n• World's greatest stretch: 
 5/side\n• 90/90 hip switches: 8/side\n• Band pull-apart 15 + no-money 
 external rotation 12\n• Prone Y-raise: 2 x 12\n• Pogo hops: 2 x 20\n
 • Ramp-up sets of the first lift: 2–3\n\nMain work + wall-ball strengt
 h (50 min\, 4 sets\, 1–2 reps in reserve):\n1. Med-ball squat throw stra
 ight up ★ (wall-ball strength): 5 x 5\, all-out\, 60 s rest\n2. Front sq
 uat 🏅 + box jumps (wall-ball strength): 4 x 5 at 70–80% of max\, 3 bo
 x jumps straight after each set\, 2–3 min rest\n3. Bulgarian split squat
  ★: 3 x 8 each\, 90 s rest\n4. Single-leg RDL to press ★: 3 x 8 each\,
  60 s rest\n5. Banded hip thrust ★: 3 x 8–10\, 1 s squeeze at the top\
 , 90 s rest\n6. Nordic curl ★: 3 x 5–6\, lower as slowly as you can\, 
 90 s rest\n7. Leg extension\, seat reclined 🏅: 2 x 12–15\, 60 s rest\
 n8. Standing barbell calf raise 3 x 10 + bent-knee soleus raise 2 x 15\, 6
 0 s rest\n\nNo functional block today: Thursday's full simulation already 
 covered every station\, rowing and carries included.\n\nEvening (optional\
 , 10 min):\n• World's greatest stretch: 5/side\n• 90/90 hip switches: 
 8/side\n• Prone neck series on a yoga block\n\nhttps://andyxuedct.github
 .io/Training-Plan/
