 ip switches: 8/side\n• Band pull-apart 15 + no-money external rotation 1
 2\n• Prone Y-raise: 2 x 12\n• Pogo hops: 2 x 20\n• Ramp-up sets of t
 he first lift: 2–3\n\nMain work (35 min\, cut by a third: 2 sets each\, 
 same weights):\n1. Flat DB press: 2 x 10–12\, 90 s rest\n2. Machine ches
 t press 🏅: 2 x 8–10\, 90 s rest\n3. Seated cable row: 2 x 10–12\, 9
 0 s rest\n4. Pec deck: 2 x 12–15\, 60 s rest\n5. Half-kneeling single-ar
 m pulldown: 2 x 10–12 each\, 60 s rest\n6. Straight-arm cable pulldown: 
 2 x 12–15\, 60 s rest\n7. Seated DB shoulder press: 2 x 8–10\, 90 s re
 st\n\nArms and shoulders (10 min):\n1. Face pull: 2 x 15\, 60 s rest\n2. O
 verhead rope extension 🏅 + curl: 2 x 10–12\, alternating\, 60 s rest\
 n3. Rope pushdown + hammer curl: 2 x 12\, alternating\, 60 s rest\n\nPull-
 up Day 2:\n• 3 sets at 60% of your max\n\nFunctional: core and rotation 
 (15 min\, the one core block of the week):\n• Med-ball rotational throw 
 against a wall ★ (first\, all-out): 2 x 5 per side\, 60 s rest\n• Then
  2 rounds: cable woodchop\, high to low\, 10/side\n• Pallof press: 10/si
 de\n• Copenhagen plank ★: 20 s/side\n• Dead bug: 10/side\n• Leg-ra
 ise crunch: 12\n\nSwim (15 min\, about 400 m easy):\n• 8 x 50 m\, 20 s r
 est\n• Relaxed breathing\n\nhttps://andyxuedct.github.io/Training-Plan/
